<b>Goldfish Scooping</b>

03:14.570 --> 03:16.110
<b>You look like you need something to do.</b>

03:18.080 --> 03:19.080
<b>Me?</b>

03:22.750 --> 03:24.620
<b>The name’s Shouko, and I’m running goldfish scooping.</b>

03:24.620 --> 03:27.380
<b>My name’s written as “smiling child.”</b>

03:27.390 --> 03:28.290
<b>What’s your name, boy?</b>

03:28.290 --> 03:31.120
<b>Sakakura Ryousuke...</b>

03:31.120 --> 03:32.420
<b>All right, Ryou-chan.</b>

03:32.420 --> 03:34.430
<b>Could you bring those over here for me?</b>

03:37.830 --> 03:38.930
<b>That...?</b>

03:38.930 --> 03:43.100
<b>A youngster like you shouldn’t be lazing about.</b>

03:43.100 --> 03:43.900
<b>Let’s put you to work.</b>

03:46.870 --> 03:47.770
<b>I’m thinking...</b>

03:49.340 --> 03:54.310
<b>Maybe tomorrow, or the day after,
after the festival’s over...</b>

03:54.310 --> 03:56.350
<b>...I’m thinking of going home to Yokohama.</b>

03:57.080 --> 03:59.650
<b>Ah, okay.</b>

03:59.650 --> 04:02.450
<b>Have you told your mom already?</b>

04:02.450 --> 04:05.320
<b>I’ll call her later.</b>

04:06.320 --> 04:08.990
<b>So how was your time here in Tana?</b>

04:08.990 --> 04:10.800
<b>I’m not finished here, so...</b>

04:12.700 --> 04:14.300
<b>I see.</b>

04:14.300 --> 04:15.470
<b>I don’t know much about it...</b>

04:15.470 --> 04:18.170
<b>...but you must be thinking <i>that</i>
will be ending soon, right?</b>

04:19.970 --> 04:22.270
<b>Sometime tonight, probably.</b>

04:24.680 --> 04:28.180
<b>Considering what day it is,
I doubt there’ll be any emergencies...</b>

04:25.740 --> 04:29.110
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:28.180 --> 04:30.180
<b>...so why don’t I close the vet for the day?</b>

04:30.180 --> 04:31.950
<b>We can go to the festival for a bit.</b>

04:33.290 --> 04:35.090
<b>Ah... you don’t have to do that.</b>

04:37.060 --> 04:38.660
<b>It was just a joke...</b>

04:40.530 --> 04:43.960
<b>Miku! If you’re going to come, you have to hurry up!</b>

04:46.630 --> 04:48.500
<b>Miku!</b>

04:54.710 --> 04:55.770
<b>Aizawa-kun?</b>

04:56.980 --> 04:58.540
<b>Hello? Miyama speaking.</b>

04:59.480 --> 05:01.450
<b>Are you free right now?</b>

05:01.450 --> 05:06.320
<b>Yeah. I was just about to go pick up Mika-nee
at the station, but it’s okay.</b>

05:07.820 --> 05:08.450
<b>What is it?</b>

05:09.090 --> 05:10.320
<b>Umm...</b>

05:10.320 --> 05:11.260
<b>Yeah?</b>

05:11.260 --> 05:14.530
<b>I don’t know if I’ll be able to go tonight or not...</b>

05:14.530 --> 05:17.930
<b>...but if I can, I’d like to go around
the festival with you.</b>

05:19.770 --> 05:20.770
<b>Hello?</b>

05:20.770 --> 05:22.570
<b>Yeah... okay.</b>

05:23.270 --> 05:25.540
<b>Sorry for being so ambiguous...</b>

05:25.540 --> 05:28.240
<b>No problem. Then, what should we do?</b>

05:28.240 --> 05:30.340
<b>Should I just wait for you where
the festival’s being held?</b>

05:30.340 --> 05:32.340
<b>Yeah. I’ll call you later.</b>

05:33.850 --> 05:35.550
<b>I’ll be waiting.</b>

05:35.550 --> 05:36.580
<b>Bye.</b>

05:41.890 --> 05:42.520
<b>Miku!</b>

05:47.560 --> 05:49.160
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

05:49.160 --> 05:50.660
<b>I think I caught a cold...</b>

05:54.770 --> 05:56.270
<b>You have a fever.</b>

05:57.440 --> 05:59.170
<b>I thought so...</b>

06:01.410 --> 06:04.480
<b>I’ll pick up Mika-nee by myself.</b>

06:04.480 --> 06:07.010
<b>In the meantime, take some medicine
and lie down, okay?</b>

06:07.010 --> 06:07.610
<b>Yes, ma’am...</b>

06:07.610 --> 06:10.310
<b>All right, I’m going to take the picture now!</b>

06:15.190 --> 06:17.090
<b>Don’t do that. Come on.</b>

06:17.890 --> 06:19.060
<b>I’m taking it now!</b>

06:21.660 --> 06:23.590
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

06:25.800 --> 06:27.570
<b>Are you here as a customer?</b>

06:27.570 --> 06:29.070
<b>Or just window-shopping?</b>

06:31.740 --> 06:33.200
<b>What’s this?</b>

06:33.210 --> 06:35.910
<b>We still have some time before the festival...</b>

06:35.910 --> 06:38.340
<b>...so I asked him to help out for a bit.</b>

06:40.380 --> 06:44.320
<b>Is bottled water what you want? Hm?</b>

06:45.950 --> 06:49.450
<b>Umm... aren’t I the customer here?</b>

06:49.450 --> 06:50.590
<b>Is this really all right?</b>

06:50.590 --> 06:53.390
<b>It’s because he’s Heigorou-san.</b>

06:53.390 --> 06:54.560
<b>It’s just how he is.</b>

07:06.870 --> 07:09.010
<b>It’s just a passing shower.</b>

07:09.010 --> 07:12.210
<b>Today’s forecast did say it would be cloudy with rain.</b>

07:12.210 --> 07:14.120
<b>But it also said it should clear up by evening.</b>

07:14.780 --> 07:18.280
<b>We’ll still hold it. The guests have
started arriving, anyway.</b>

07:18.280 --> 07:20.190
<b>Yes. It won’t be cancelled.</b>

07:20.690 --> 07:23.090
<b>The Cat Dance is still on.</b>

07:23.090 --> 07:24.920
<b>Roger that!</b>

07:31.330 --> 07:34.060
<b>Hello! Sukawara Akira here!</b>

07:34.730 --> 07:37.540
<b>Su-ka-wa-ra! Be careful not to misread it!</b>

07:37.540 --> 07:42.640
<b>Today, I’ve come to the site of the
Cat Dance here in Kannagi, Tana.</b>

07:42.640 --> 07:46.240
<b>This place has been surrounded by
mysterious rumors all summer.</b>

07:46.240 --> 07:50.750
<b>In addition to the rumors, some bizarre phenomena have been taking place, too.</b>

07:50.750 --> 07:54.090
<b>Perhaps at tonight’s Cat Dance, we might–</b>

07:57.420 --> 07:59.420
<b>What are you doing?</b>

07:59.420 --> 08:02.060
<b>It’s been decided that the Cat Dance will go on!</b>

08:04.530 --> 08:07.670
<b>I really have no idea what you’re hoping for...</b>

08:07.670 --> 08:09.730
<b>...but I’ll tell you this...</b>

08:09.730 --> 08:12.270
<b>Don’t let your guard down. Understood?</b>

08:12.270 --> 08:13.270
<b>I’ll be fine.</b>

08:13.270 --> 08:15.470
<b>I’ll report what I see just as it is.</b>

08:22.510 --> 08:25.380
<b>Straw sandals hung on a rope?</b>

08:25.380 --> 08:27.320
<b>That’d be a barrier, I’d say.</b>

08:27.320 --> 08:29.690
<b>It closes off the path?</b>

08:29.690 --> 08:31.660
<b>It’s a charm that’s been used since long ago.</b>

08:31.660 --> 08:34.590
<b>No... more like it was only used long ago.</b>

08:35.230 --> 08:36.990
<b>Plagues and monsters...</b>

08:37.000 --> 08:41.430
<b>In order to ward off calamities from
entering a village or families...</b>

08:41.430 --> 08:44.100
<b>...it marked the boundary for what was
within, and what was without.</b>

08:44.100 --> 08:46.600
<b>Its role is similar to sacred ropes or the Ksitigarbha Bodhisattva statues...</b>

08:46.600 --> 08:49.870
<b>...you see in wayside shrines.</b>

08:49.880 --> 08:53.480
<b>And you’re not supposed to go beyond it?</b>

08:53.480 --> 08:56.780
<b>That which brings calamity cannot pass.</b>

08:56.780 --> 08:58.590
<b>Then if you don’t, could you pass it?</b>

08:58.590 --> 09:01.420
<b>Well, I suppose.</b>

09:01.420 --> 09:05.290
<b>Then, do you think a place that you wouldn’t
be able to return from once you passed...</b>

09:06.360 --> 09:08.790
<b>...has anything to do with the world’s membrane?</b>

09:09.930 --> 09:14.570
<b>The Palace of the Dragon King,
Eden, Agartha, Shangri-La...</b>

09:14.570 --> 09:17.900
<b>There are many terms used to describe such
places, but simply put, they’re other worlds.</b>

09:18.600 --> 09:23.370
<b>While they may touch our world
at points, they are not of it.</b>

09:23.380 --> 09:25.180
<b>In other words, beyond the membrane.</b>

09:27.640 --> 09:32.020
<b>Did you find a blocked-off entrance
into one of those other worlds?</b>

09:45.730 --> 09:47.930
<b>I wonder if the rain will stop...</b>

09:51.740 --> 09:52.310
<b>What is it?</b>

09:54.070 --> 09:56.070
<b>Taruto, be quiet.</b>

10:02.110 --> 10:03.370
<b>Is something out here?</b>

10:29.130 --> 10:30.570
<b>Did you see yesterday’s episode?</b>

10:30.570 --> 10:31.370
<b>Nope...</b>

10:31.370 --> 10:32.770
<b>This nice makeup set showed up on it.</b>

10:32.770 --> 10:33.470
<b>Really?</b>

10:33.470 --> 10:38.180
<b>It’s really expensive, but I’m thinking of buying it!</b>

10:38.180 --> 10:39.250
<b>You should!</b>

10:44.080 --> 10:45.550
<b>Oh, it let up!</b>

10:48.030 --> 10:49.530
<b>Bright and sunny woman power!</b>

11:07.850 --> 11:09.210
<b>Hello?</b>

11:25.600 --> 11:27.130
<b></b>It Conquers Everything

11:25.600 --> 11:27.130
<b></b>Because Love Exists

11:30.100 --> 11:31.770
<b>Why is this happening again...?</b>

11:32.500 --> 11:35.440
<b>This isn’t the time to be sleeping. This is...</b>

11:34.610 --> 11:35.440
<b>Miku!</b>

11:35.440 --> 11:36.870
<b>Mika-nee’s here!</b>

11:36.880 --> 11:38.740
<b>I’m home!</b>

11:56.730 --> 11:58.900
<b>Shouko-san. Shouko-san!</b>

11:58.900 --> 12:00.770
<b>What is it?</b>

12:00.770 --> 12:01.300
<b>Look at this.</b>

12:03.770 --> 12:05.570
<b>What is this?</b>

12:05.570 --> 12:08.740
<b>I dunno. Maybe they got a little frenzied
from a minor earthquake?</b>

12:19.150 --> 12:20.580
<b>Hello?</b>

12:21.650 --> 12:22.620
<b>What is this?</b>

12:22.620 --> 12:24.020
<b>Hello?</b>

12:34.800 --> 12:36.500
<b>Here it comes!</b>

12:50.780 --> 12:54.050
<b>If you’re looking for Ayumu, he left earlier
this afternoon and hasn’t been back.</b>

12:57.060 --> 12:58.360
<b>Miku!</b>

12:59.490 --> 13:00.930
<b>I’m really sorry.</b>

13:00.930 --> 13:04.100
<b>That girl said calling you wouldn’t be good enough and ran out, disturbing you like this.</b>

13:04.100 --> 13:11.440
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

13:04.730 --> 13:06.560
<b>I don’t really mind, but...</b>

13:06.570 --> 13:09.500
<b>...did Ayumu stand you up or something?</b>

13:09.500 --> 13:11.440
<b>Oh, no, it’s nothing like that.</b>

13:12.140 --> 13:13.840
<b>Sorry for bothering you.</b>

13:20.950 --> 13:23.010
<b>What’s wrong, Miku?</b>

13:23.010 --> 13:23.780
<b>Wakkun...</b>

13:24.880 --> 13:26.680
<b>...<i>seriously</i> intends to play.</b>

14:32.920 --> 14:34.420
<b>You’re all made up now, but...</b>

14:40.030 --> 14:41.990
<b>Do you want to skip out of the Dance this time?</b>

14:41.990 --> 14:45.100
<b>I’ll be fine with just Mika-nee.</b>

14:45.100 --> 14:46.300
<b>I’ll go.</b>

14:46.300 --> 14:47.700
<b>I have to go.</b>

14:48.270 --> 14:51.340
<b>“Wakkun seriously intends to play...”</b>

14:51.340 --> 14:53.240
<b>What did you mean by that?</b>

14:53.240 --> 14:54.570
<b>Who knows?</b>

14:55.910 --> 14:57.310
<b>Are you two ready yet?</b>

14:57.310 --> 14:59.540
<b>We should get going soon.</b>

14:59.540 --> 15:01.750
<b>We’ll be down in a minute!</b>

15:01.750 --> 15:04.650
<b>Is there anything I can do
to help with this?</b>

15:04.650 --> 15:06.250
<b>No.</b>

15:06.250 --> 15:07.120
<b>As I expected.</b>

15:07.990 --> 15:10.450
<b>But promise me one thing, at least.</b>

15:10.460 --> 15:15.130
<b>If you start feeling worse, you’ll sit out of
the contest and rest here at the house.</b>

15:15.130 --> 15:16.130
<b>Okay?</b>

15:17.130 --> 15:18.760
<b>Yes, ma’am...</b>

15:18.760 --> 15:21.030
<b>Good girl. Then, let’s go.</b>

15:32.740 --> 15:34.910
<b>I wonder if this weather will last...</b>

15:34.910 --> 15:37.850
<b>After finally coming here, we’ll get nothing
done if you keep worrying about that.</b>

15:39.790 --> 15:41.350
<b>So...</b>

15:41.350 --> 15:43.420
<b>...do you know the origins of the Cat Dance?</b>

15:43.420 --> 15:47.830
<b>That would of course be... the cat Shiro
from the Moriya house, right?</b>

15:47.830 --> 15:50.900
<b>And... the conclusion to that story is?</b>

15:51.430 --> 15:54.770
<b>Being forced out by Mr. So-and-So,
Shiro left the house.</b>

15:54.770 --> 15:56.870
<b>Well, that’s what most people say.</b>

15:56.870 --> 15:59.140
<b>That’s not it?</b>

15:59.140 --> 16:01.370
<b>There’s another version.</b>

16:01.370 --> 16:04.310
<b>Or rather, I guess you’d call it a sequel.</b>

16:04.310 --> 16:05.080
<b>A sequel?</b>

16:06.010 --> 16:08.750
<b>Cats playing flutes and dancing...</b>

16:08.750 --> 16:11.520
<b>Any way you look at that,
they’re clearly demon cats.</b>

16:11.520 --> 16:14.950
<b>Having driven Shiro out, the master
thought he might be cursed...</b>

