<b>Yeah. But that’s the clincher.</b>

16:23.530 --> 16:28.600
<b>After he did that, bizarre events started
happening in the Moriya house.</b>

16:28.600 --> 16:30.900
<b>Even though he built that mound?</b>

16:30.900 --> 16:34.000
<b>It’s possible that it had the opposite
effect, and drew Shiro back.</b>

16:34.510 --> 16:37.780
<b>At any rate, the greatly troubled master
decided that once a year...</b>

16:37.780 --> 16:40.640
<b>...everyone in the house would dress up
and dance like Shiro and his friends...</b>

16:40.650 --> 16:42.880
<b>...to try to suppress those bizarre events.</b>

16:42.880 --> 16:45.980
<b>Isn’t that... the same as our Cat Dance now?</b>

16:45.980 --> 16:50.960
<b>Though... the meaning seems to
have been lost along the way.</b>

16:50.960 --> 16:52.320
<b>Yep.</b>

16:52.320 --> 16:57.030
<b>And that’s about when “Moriya”
changed into “Touya,” I think.</b>

16:58.630 --> 17:01.370
<b>That’s pretty interesting.</b>

17:03.500 --> 17:04.800
<b>What’s the matter?</b>

17:04.800 --> 17:06.600
<b>No... it’s nothing.</b>

17:40.310 --> 17:41.710
<b>You’re looking at it again.</b>

17:43.110 --> 17:44.880
<b>You can’t go that way.</b>

17:44.880 --> 17:46.010
<b>Wakkun...</b>

17:47.380 --> 17:48.050
<b>Let’s play!</b>

17:50.320 --> 17:51.520
<b>Okay.</b>

17:55.690 --> 17:57.520
<b>He still hasn’t come back.</b>

17:57.520 --> 18:01.990
<b>I think he’ll probably head to the festival
on his own from wherever he is now.</b>

18:01.990 --> 18:03.590
<b>Is that so?</b>

18:03.600 --> 18:05.230
<b>I understand.</b>

18:08.200 --> 18:11.110
<b>Taku</b>

18:11.110 --> 18:12.170
<b>Dialing</b>

18:11.110 --> 18:12.170
<b>Taku</b>

18:14.070 --> 18:18.110
<b>The phone you are attempting to
call is either out of range or–</b>

18:26.380 --> 18:27.850
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:28.990 --> 18:30.350
<b>Wait for me here.</b>

18:30.360 --> 18:31.720
<b>I’m going out.</b>

18:34.360 --> 18:36.860
<b>Mom, I think I’m going to go to the festival after all!</b>

18:36.860 --> 18:39.760
<b>The Cat Dance contest...</b>

18:39.770 --> 18:46.300
<b>...will begin on Tana Elementary
School’s stage tonight at 6:00.</b>

