19:04.260 --> 19:06.720
<b>We’re still accepting entries at our desk...</b>

19:05.920 --> 19:06.720
<b>Here you go.</b>

19:07.230 --> 19:10.190
<b>Better do a good job and show your
girlfriend how good you are at this!</b>

19:13.400 --> 19:16.930
<b>Ryou-chan, this isn’t your first time doing this, is it?</b>

19:16.940 --> 19:20.000
<b>You give the normal #6 to girls,
and the thin #7 to guys!</b>

19:20.010 --> 19:20.910
<b>That’s common sense!</b>

19:21.540 --> 19:23.470
<b>Then what about the purple-rimmed one?</b>

19:23.480 --> 19:26.510
<b>That’s for someone special,
or someone who’s high-profile.</b>

19:26.510 --> 19:28.010
<b>That’s what I say, at least.</b>

19:28.010 --> 19:29.510
<b>Hey, I’ve been looking for you.</b>

19:31.520 --> 19:33.080
<b>My, my...</b>

19:33.090 --> 19:35.720
<b>Would this be your special someone
in this noisy crowd?</b>

19:35.720 --> 19:38.660
<b>Shouko-san... you’re kind of scary
when you smile like that.</b>

19:38.660 --> 19:41.130
<b>Ryousuke, I want to ask you for a favor.</b>

19:43.230 --> 19:44.330
<b>Why don’t you listen to her?</b>

19:44.330 --> 19:45.160
<b>What is it?</b>

19:49.370 --> 19:51.370
<b>Please go to the Touya Forest.</b>

20:20.570 --> 20:22.030
<b>Amu, again!</b>

20:24.840 --> 20:27.510
<b>It’s already starting to get dark out...</b>

20:27.510 --> 20:29.410
<b>Agaaaain!</b>

20:29.410 --> 20:30.980
<b>Umm...</b>

20:30.980 --> 20:31.740
<b>I...</b>

20:34.680 --> 20:37.820
<b>I’ll... be going home soon.</b>

20:37.820 --> 20:39.520
<b>Going home?</b>

20:39.520 --> 20:42.320
<b>I won’t be here anymore,
so we won’t be able to play.</b>

20:42.320 --> 20:43.820
<b>You won’t go!</b>

20:43.820 --> 20:45.190
<b>Amu, you’ll be able to play with me!</b>

20:45.820 --> 20:47.360
<b>But...</b>

20:47.360 --> 20:48.960
<b>You won’t...</b>

20:49.460 --> 20:50.530
<b>But...</b>

20:50.530 --> 20:53.200
<b>Amu, you won’t!</b>

20:53.200 --> 20:54.630
<b>Umm...</b>

20:54.630 --> 20:56.370
<b>I don’t like waiting...</b>

20:58.000 --> 21:00.640
<b>Amu... you named Dosshiru and Shisshin.</b>

21:08.110 --> 21:09.550
<b>Dosshiru!</b>

21:09.550 --> 21:11.150
<b>What’s that?</b>

21:11.150 --> 21:12.150
<b>Its name.</b>

21:12.150 --> 21:13.620
<b>Shisshin!</b>

21:18.920 --> 21:23.160
<b>Amu, you named Dosshiru and Shisshin.</b>

21:23.160 --> 21:27.100
<b>Because you said you’d play
with me, I waited for you.</b>

21:27.100 --> 21:29.170
<b>And you came.</b>

21:29.170 --> 21:30.130
<b>And we played.</b>

21:33.170 --> 21:38.140
<b>Tana Neighborhood Council</b>

21:55.790 --> 21:58.200
<b>Miku, are you all right?</b>

21:59.000 --> 22:03.600
<b>The Cat Dance contest will begin shortly.</b>

22:03.600 --> 22:05.170
<b>Participants, please...</b>

22:10.740 --> 22:12.340
<b>What...</b>

22:12.340 --> 22:13.640
<b>...am I supposed to do?</b>

22:14.850 --> 22:16.280
<b>Come with me.</b>

22:17.380 --> 22:18.680
<b>Let’s go!</b>

22:19.520 --> 22:21.320
<b>We’ll always be together.</b>

22:21.320 --> 22:23.220
<b>We’ll play forever.</b>

22:23.220 --> 22:24.360
<b>Let’s go!</b>

22:25.190 --> 22:27.630
<b>Amu, let’s go!</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.970 --> 24:22.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:20.510 --> 24:22.870
<b>Tomorrow’s finally the day of the Cat Dance.</b>

24:22.870 --> 24:26.080
<b>Hey! Look at me in my sexy yukata figure!</b>

24:26.080 --> 24:30.610
<b>I’d say those colors are blinding, and you
look like a trained monkey doing tricks.</b>

24:30.620 --> 24:32.850
<b>Who are you going to the festival with, Taruto?</b>

24:32.850 --> 24:34.150
<b>Umm... Nene-chan.</b>

24:34.150 --> 24:36.390
<b>Nene-chan has a boyfriend, right?</b>

24:36.390 --> 24:40.320
<b>She can’t have it both ways, so if she had
to pick one, it definitely wouldn’t be you.</b>

24:40.330 --> 24:42.090
<b>Isn’t that going a bit too far?</b>

24:42.090 --> 24:44.330
<b>I think it might be better to comfort
her at a time like this...</b>

24:44.330 --> 24:48.670
<b>Taruto-chan, it’ll probably rain tomorrow anyway, and the whole festival will be called off.</b>

24:48.670 --> 24:49.770
<b>Now you’ve made her cry!</b>

24:49.770 --> 24:53.140
<b>Oh, I know! Why don’t you go with
me tomorrow, Taruto-chan?</b>

24:53.140 --> 24:56.010
<b>Next time: “Run to Tana, Which
is on the Verge of Tears.”</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>Run to Tana,
Which is on the Verge of Tears</b>

24:56.010 --> 24:58.210
<b>I’d never go with you, Rokkun!</b>
